```css
.sun-day {
    background: yellow;
}

.sun-sunset {
    background: red;
}
```

4. **Conditional CSS Classes**: Use conditional statements in your HTML to apply the appropriate CSS class based on the current time of day. For example:

```html
<div class="sun <?php if ($current_time >= 6 && $current_time <= 18) echo 'sun-day'; else echo 'sun-sunset'; ?>"></div>
