In this example, the `sun` element will have the `sun-day` class between 6 AM and 6 PM, and the `sun-sunset` class between 6 PM and 6 AM.

5. **CSS Transitions**: To make the transition between the two sun appearances smooth, you can use CSS transitions. Add the following code to your CSS file:

```css
.sun {
    transition: background-color 0.5s ease;
}
```

This will apply a 0.5 second transition to the background color of the `sun` element when the CSS class changes.

